contentText:
Alanis Morissette identifies as pansexual, she revealed in a podcast appearance earlier this week. The hitmaker &#8212; who just dropped her first holiday album, Good Weather for Immaculate Conception , featuring new single &#8220;To an Empath at Christmas Time&#8221; &#8212; visited the Handsome Podcast as the podcast trio&#8217;s first in-person guest for an episode that was uploaded on Nov. 3.

